[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"set","variable":1,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“我一次又一次地重复着。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“在回忆之中，重复过着那个夏天。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“想要在过去之中寻找未来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“付出了很多努力，也绕了很多弯路……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“最后，愿望终于实现了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“我终于和妈妈一起，度过了一个快乐的夏天。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“我以为自己已经满足了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“真的很满足了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“可是……为什么呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“当期盼已久的愿望实现后，又萌生出了新的愿望。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“我还真是任性啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“明明我的愿望已经实现了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“却因为经历过了那个夏天。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“我……又开始期盼。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“想要再和妈妈……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“……还有爸爸三个人……一起度过夏天。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“暑假已经不会重来了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“也不再有我所在的那个暑假。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“那一切都是只属于我的回忆。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“即使所有人都已经遗忘，我也不会忘记。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“在这个只残留有夏日湛蓝的世界里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“即使会永远迷失下去，我也绝不会忘记。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“那道炫目的光辉――……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“终于找到你了。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i25178"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“你打算迷路到什么时候啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“我虽然很擅长追人，但可不太会找人哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“来我这边。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“去哪里？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“你一直在不断重复的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“那个夏天。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“但是，你从来没有停下脚步。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“一直都在迈向前方。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“真的很了不起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“所以，稍微休息一下吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“然后回过头去看看吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“你轮回过的那些夏天，在其前方还存在着另一个夏天。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“……回过头去……看到前方的夏天？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“你已经很努力了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“你确实将未来衔接在了一起啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“你听，有没有听到？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟","text":"“那呼唤你的声音――”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i25178"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"湛蓝的世界渐渐远去，一切都被炫目的光辉所笼罩。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的意识也陷入了朦胧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"已经，要结束了吗……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然知道这一天总会到来，我这个模糊的存在终于要消失了啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就像从梦中醒来一样……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我轻轻握住了手中无比珍贵的回忆。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"安静地……缓缓地呼出一口气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后吸气的时候……"},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":259},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1796"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我闻到了令人怀念的香气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"海潮――……和青草――……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还有那个夏天的香气――……"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"眼前是一片湛蓝的天空。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"空中飘浮着白得刺眼的云朵。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"强烈的阳光把皮肤晒得火辣辣的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为太过刺眼，我闭上了眼睛……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1797"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“这里……是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我迷迷糊糊地思考着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想不太明白。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未――”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未――”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我听到了声音。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那是我以为再也听不到的声音……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那是我只能一次又一次在脑海中回想的声音……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未，你在哪里――”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“找到了，在那儿。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"脚步声……越来越近。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两个的脚步声径直朝这边走来……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未，你怎么在这里睡觉呀？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你突然就不见了，我们找了好久呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1798"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“这附近有悬崖，很危险的哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1800"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“啊……啊啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈、妈……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯？怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“爸爸……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是不是哪里受伤了？有什么地方疼吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1799"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜呜呜……呜……呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈……爸爸……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈……！爸爸……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“早、早、上好……早上好……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我想对你们……对妈妈和爸爸……说早上好……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“一直都想……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“一直都想……对你们说一次……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“早上好……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“是嘛，早上好，羽未。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“虽然有点赖床呢，早上好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯……早上好……”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i740"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有一句一直都想说出来的话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那是一句再平常不过的，每天都会随口说出的话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正因为如此，才显得格外珍贵。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"理所当然般的怀念，包裹着我的双手。"},{"op":"clear","layer":256},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1801"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"右边的手，温柔而又柔软。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":256},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1802"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"左边的手，坚实而又有力。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嘿嘿……爸爸。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什么事？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1804"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“没什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"温暖的光辉包围着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“今天怎么这么爱撒娇啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我已经多久没有和羽未牵着手了呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不是才两个多小时吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可我想一直牵着啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯，我也是。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽，爸爸我现在高兴死了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未，想不想也和妈妈一直牵着手呀？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“呵呵，妈妈也很高兴哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的两只手和妈妈和爸爸牵在一起。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紧紧地牵在一起。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我记得这份温暖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即使在炎热的夏日中，依然能感到这双手的温暖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然间，我停下脚步回头望去。"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1805"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“掉了什么东西吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……脚印。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“有三串脚印呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那毕竟我们是三个人一起走的嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1806"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从来……都只有一串的脚印，现在变成了三串。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今后也是。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"无论度过多少次夏天，我们都是一家人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈，你饿不饿呀？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“是哦，都已经过了中午呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那，就让爸爸来做吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“炒饭吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“当然了，妈妈亲传的炒饭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那我来做也可以吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未应该还做不出那个味道吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“大概没问题的哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我会做出好吃的炒饭哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那就拜托你了哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一路不断前行，终于将心中的思念。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这时，我终于找到了那温暖的手心。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“爸爸，妈妈。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在无数次夏天里遇见的，点点滴滴的温柔相连在了一起。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将这一切化作回忆。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"迈向下一个夏天。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“下一个暑假也好期待呀。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]